@title Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (USA)
@file Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (U) [!].gba
@game A3AE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen mgba,nba
@save skip: the cart gets only its boot-time records until a stage is cleared; the first save needs 1-1 played to the goal ring (saved on the return to the map). Not reached: after the first bush column (cleared by a flutter jump from the white rock) and the egg-block bridge, a white rock overhangs the next mound and the flutter from the column top lands below it (below_white_block); the log bridge with the up arrow on top of that mound was not reached

# Single Player > Yoshi's Island > FILE A > story (A every 40) > 1-1: the
# message block, eat the two Shy Guys on the log bridge (B, DOWN for eggs),
# over the bush hill, onto the white rock, jump + flutter onto the first bush
# column (column_top), flutter right.
# Frozen on mgba and nba only: dingbat-bios leaves them at stage_start. With
# the same inputs (a three-emulator session) dingbat-bios already shows pink
# tulip buds on the first bush where mgba/nba show white puffs at f4304, has a
# Shy Guy standing at the bush at f4790 when mgba/nba have none there yet, and
# at f4900 that Shy Guy has hit Yoshi (Baby Mario in the bubble, timer)
# while on mgba/nba both Shy Guys still walk the log bridge and Yoshi is fine.
# (shy_guys checkpoint: f4790.)
# Why (docs/playtest-bugs.md, "Super Mario Advance 3: the cart's EEPROM
# decides 1-1"): the first boot formats the blank EEPROM with 196 block
# writes polled to ready, so the EEPROM's programming time sets the frame
# phase 1-1's bushes and Shy Guy are seeded from. dingbat uses GBATEK's
# 108368 cycles, mgba ~115000, the second reference ~101000; the bush flips
# every 1-3 % of that time, so stage_start onwards is not diagnostic on a
# fresh cart (dingbat built with -d:EEPROM_SETTLE_CYCLES=115005 matches mgba
# throughout).

[new]
tap START times=5 every=60 hold=4
wait 30
checkpoint title_menu window=30 compare=text
press A after=90
wait 4
wait 30
checkpoint choose_game window=30 compare=text
press A after=120
wait 664
wait 30
checkpoint yi_title window=30 compare=text
press START after=120
wait 4
wait 24
checkpoint file_menu window=30
press A after=180
wait 604
wait 20
checkpoint story window=10
tap A times=20 every=40 hold=6
tap A times=20 every=40 hold=6
wait 200
checkpoint stage_start window=0
press RIGHT hold=90 after=5
press A after=60
press RIGHT hold=90 after=5
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
checkpoint shy_guys window=0
wait 30
press RIGHT hold=30 after=5
press RIGHT hold=40 after=5
wait 10
wait 10
press B after=25
press DOWN hold=10 after=30
press RIGHT hold=20 after=2
press B after=25
press DOWN hold=10 after=30
press RIGHT hold=60 after=2
press RIGHT hold=90 after=2
hold RIGHT+A
wait 40
hold RIGHT
wait 30
release
hold RIGHT+A
wait 45
hold RIGHT
wait 12
release
checkpoint column_top window=0
hold RIGHT+A
wait 70
hold RIGHT
wait 20
release
checkpoint below_white_block window=0

